The backend directory contains the FastAPI application and database-related code.

The mobile directory is reserved for the Flutter mobile application.

The docs directory contains project documentation.

The postman directory contains API testing resources.

11. Planned Features

The next development stages are planned as follows.

Web Management Interface

A web-based management interface will be developed for central users.

Planned functionality includes:

Fault dashboard
Fault list
Fault details
Fault editing
Fault deletion
Fault filtering
Status management
Priority management
Equipment information
Technician information
Fault category information
Flutter Mobile Application

The Flutter application will provide field technicians with a mobile interface for:

Creating fault reports
Viewing assigned faults
Updating fault status
Working with limited or no network connectivity
Synchronizing data with the backend
Offline Synchronization

The mobile application is planned to support offline fault creation.

Each locally created fault can use a client_uuid to help identify records created on the client side before synchronization.

